flowchart TD
    S([User opens SABLE website]) --> W[ApBot welcomes user]
    W --> I[User sends text or voice input]
    I --> P[Python service predicts intent]
    P --> C{Confidence >= 0.50?}
    C -- No --> F[Fallback response and scope guidance]
    C -- Yes --> R[Express resolves intent and context]
    R --> Q{Request type}
    Q -->|Product search| S1[Query Product collection]
    Q -->|Product details| D[Use last product context\nand retrieve details]
    Q -->|Recommendation| R1[Return matching or curated products]
    Q -->|FAQ/support| H[Return documented support response]
    Q -->|Order tracking| T[Find order by SBL code\nor authenticated user]
    Q -->|Size/fit| Z[Apply heuristic size guidance]
    Q -->|Checkout| A{Cart and authentication valid?}
    A -- No --> L[Ask user to add items or sign in]
    A -- Yes --> AD[Collect shipping address]
    AD --> PM[Collect mock payment method]
    PM --> O[Create demonstration Order document]
    S1 --> E[Format message, data, actions, context]
    D --> E
    R1 --> E
    H --> E
    T --> E
    Z --> E
    L --> E
    O --> E
    F --> E
    E --> U[React renders answer, cards, forms, or action]
    U --> N{Continue conversation?}
    N -- Yes --> I
    N -- No --> X([Conversation ends])
